# Demo-mode environment for the Playwright journeys (contract §9).
# `npm run dev -- --mode demo` loads this file INSTEAD of .env.local:
# VITE_API_URL=/api/v1 forces the dev proxy (vite.config.ts → :8000), so the
# browser talks to the local demo backend (DEMO_MODE=1) same-origin and the
# portal-auth cookies work. Never point this at the Render backend.
VITE_API_URL=/api/v1
